<p>After <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 4, 3, 3, 3</acronym> turns, the target area in (radius 2) is blasted with a beam of light, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">184, 248, 298, 340, 377</acronym> damage and lighting the area</p>